  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "Point \\(E\\) is on side \\(AB\\) of square \\(ABCD.\\) If \\(EB\\) has length one and \\(EC\\) has length two, then the area of the square is",
  "answerChoices": [
    {
      "label": "A",
      "text": "\\(\\sqrt3\\)"
    },
